index 0000000..5052de3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/68210.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Added support for ``min`` usage alerts to the ``diskusage`` beacon, so a mount
+can also fire when its usage drops below an expected floor (typically caused
+by a filesystem silently failing to mount). Configure it with a dict
+containing ``min`` and/or ``max`` percentages instead of a plain percentage;
+existing plain-percentage configuration continues to work unchanged.
